pages
mapFunctionsBasics
	^HelpTopic
		title: '4] Basic Functions' "has to be updated manually"
		icon: (HelpIcons iconNamed: #mapPinIcon)
		contents: 'MAP FUNCTIONS: Basics
----------------------------------------------

Scroll:
Place the cursor in the map area and hold left-click to pan the map.


Zoom:
Place the cursor in the map area and scroll to zoom.
Alternatively, you can place the cursor in the map area and use the + and - keys to zoom in on the area the cursor is pointing to. To zoom in on the center of the current map view, place the cursor outside the map area and press the + and - keys.


Search:
To search for a location, enter its name in the search bar in the upper-left corner and click the Search button right next to it, or press the Enter key. Below the search bar a detailed name or address appears.
You can search for any location, city, lake, or address you like.
'